 ("South Kelowna Slopes", "2022", 49.80, -119.46, "A sub-GI (2022) of about 800 ha on the slopes above the east side of Okanagan Lake south of Kelowna, home to historic vineyards such as CedarCreek and St. Hubertus; cool, lake-moderated Pinot Noir and Riesling.", "Pinot Noir, Riesling, Chardonnay, Gewürztraminer"),
